---
// The 9-step TFBO cycle split into Functionality Phase (1-3) and Efficiency Phase (4-9).
const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="ge5b">
  <div class="ge5b-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Nine-step Efficiency-Aware Development Flow (TFBO): steps 1 to 3 verify correctness first, steps 4 to 8 benchmark against RAER and profile bottlenecks before optimizing one level at a time, and step 9 releases.">
      {/* Left zone: Functionality Phase */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="290" height="254" rx="10" class="ge5b-zone" />
      <text x="28" y="42" class="ge5b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Functionality Phase (TDD)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Pha Chức năng (TDD trước)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="28" y="60" width="262" height="46" rx="6" class="ge5b-box" />
      <text x="40" y="80" class="ge5b-b">1. Test correctness first</text>
      <text x="40" y="96" class="ge5b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Unit &amp; integration tests pass</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Viết test kiểm tra chạy đúng logic</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="28" y="124" width="262" height="46" rx="6" class="ge5b-box" />
      <text x="40" y="144" class="ge5b-b">2. Meets specs (FR)?</text>
      <text x="40" y="160" class="ge5b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>No → Step 3 fix · Yes → Step 4</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chưa → qua bước 3 · Đạt → qua bước 4</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="28" y="188" width="262" height="58" rx="6" class="ge5b-box is-red" />
      <text x="40" y="208" class="ge5b-b-red">3. Implement / Fix cleanly</text>
      <text x="40" y="226" class="ge5b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Keep readable; re-run Step 1</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ưu tiên code sạch, quay lại bước 1</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Connector arrow */}
      <line x1="304" y1="147" x2="338" y2="147" class="ge5b-wire" />
      <polygon points="342,147 334,142 334,152" class="ge5b-head" />

      {/* Right zone: Efficiency Phase */}
      <rect x="344" y="16" width="542" height="254" rx="10" class="ge5b-zone is-eff" />
      <text x="360" y="42" class="ge5b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Efficiency Phase (Benchmark-Driven TFBO)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Pha Hiệu năng (Đo trước khi sửa — TFBO)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="360" y="60" width="242" height="46" rx="6" class="ge5b-box" />
      <text x="372" y="80" class="ge5b-b">4. Measure baseline</text>
      <text x="372" y="96" class="ge5b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Benchmarks (-benchmem, -count=6)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chạy benchmark làm mốc so sánh</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="626" y="60" width="244" height="46" rx="6" class="ge5b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="638" y="80" class="ge5b-b-ok">5. Within RAER goals?</text>
      <text x="638" y="96" class="ge5b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Yes → Jump to Step 9 Release!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đạt rồi → sang bước 9 Release luôn!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="360" y="124" width="242" height="46" rx="6" class="ge5b-box" />
      <text x="372" y="144" class="ge5b-b">6. Profile main bottleneck</text>
      <text x="372" y="160" class="ge5b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>pprof / trace, never guess hot code</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Soi pprof / trace, không đoán mò</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="626" y="124" width="244" height="46" rx="6" class="ge5b-box" />
      <text x="638" y="144" class="ge5b-b">7. Pick ONE design level</text>
      <text x="638" y="160" class="ge5b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>System / Algo / Code — one change</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sửa đúng 1 tầng để cô lập kết quả</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="360" y="188" width="242" height="58" rx="6" class="ge5b-box is-red" />
      <text x="372" y="208" class="ge5b-b-red">8. Optimize &amp; Loop to Step 1</text>
      <text x="372" y="226" class="ge5b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Re-verify correctness + benchstat</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Phải chạy lại test + đo lại số liệu</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="626" y="188" width="244" height="58" rx="6" class="ge5b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="638" y="208" class="ge5b-b-ok">9. Ship &amp; monitor telemetry</text>
      <text x="638" y="226" class="ge5b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Watch metrics, traces &amp; profiles</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Theo dõi liên tục qua metrics/pprof</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The TFBO cycle enforces discipline: prove correctness before benchmarking, stop optimizing the moment RAER passes, and loop back to unit tests after every single optimization change.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Quy trình TFBO giữ kỷ luật rõ ràng: chạy đúng trước rồi mới đo hiệu năng, đạt ngưỡng RAER là dừng ngay, và sau mỗi lần tối ưu đều quay lại chạy test để chắc chắn không làm gãy logic.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge5b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge5b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge5b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge5b text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge5b-zone { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge5b-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge5b-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .ge5b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge5b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge5b-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge5b-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge5b-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge5b-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge5b-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge5b-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge5b-wire { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ge5b-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ge5b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
